    "title": "Cats Effect 3 Fiber Architecture and Structured Concurrency",
    "excerpt": "How Cats Effect 3 implements green-thread work-stealing fiber runtimes on the JVM to eliminate OS thread context switching overhead.",
    "author": {
      "name": "Utkarsh",
      "avatar": "U",
      "bio": "Software Development Engineer"
    },
    "date": "November 15, 2026",
