    "id": "akka-cluster-split-brain-resolver-sbr-keep-referee-vs-keep-majority",
    "image": "/blog/akka-cluster-split-brain-resolver-sbr-keep-referee-vs-keep-majority.svg",
    "title": "Akka Cluster Split-Brain Resolver (SBR): Keep-Referee vs. Keep-Majority",
