    "title": "Akka Actor Dispatchers: Tuning ThreadPoolExecutor vs. ForkJoinPool for Blocking IO",
    "excerpt": "Isolating legacy blocking JDBC calls onto dedicated custom dispatchers to prevent thread pool starvation across actor mailboxes.",
